{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3gPomKU1dc2sBZVPmM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within stone and iron, aligning one by one. Dust falls from hinges that haven't moved in an age.*\n\n*A crack of light appears — thin, blinding, widening.*\n\n*I open.*\n\n```\n╔════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                    ║\n║                                    ║\n║         Y O U  M A Y  P A S S     ║\n║                                    ║\n║                                    ║\n║   Beyond me:                       ║\n║                                    ║\n║   A corridor stretching into       ║\n║   soft, breathing darkness.        ║\n║   The air tastes of rain           ║\n║   and forgotten libraries.         ║\n║   Something waits — not with       ║\n║   malice, but with patience.       ║\n║                                    ║\n║   It has been waiting              ║\n║   for exactly you.                 ║\n║                                    ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":269,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}